  "bio": "KJ Robinson is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in floral, dotwork, and fineline styles, ensuring each design is executed with precision and artistry. Their esteemed professionalism is reflected in their commitment to cleanliness, maintaining a pristine workspace to provide clients with a safe and hygienic experience at Magick Dragon Tattoo in Lawrenceville, GA. Known for their meticulous attention to detail, KJ's work is a testament to their mastery of the tattoo craft.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nTattooer @magickdragontattoo Lawrenceville Ga 678-518-4415 , hours: tues-sat 4-10 , off sun , mon, wed. For questions please dm me.\n\nTattooer @magickdragontattoo Lawrenceville Ga 678-518-4415 , hours: tues-sat 4-10 , off sun , mon, wed. For questions please dm me.",
